OL,5,T5FSTRESS DISORDER PAYMENT FOR VETERANTj
OL,6,T5GA Falklands veteran has been paid  Tj
OL,7,T5G#100,000 by the Ministry of DefenceTj
OL,8,T5Gin a case concerning post-traumaticTj
OL,9,T5Gstress disorder, his lawyer says.  Tj
OL,10,T5F                                   Tj
OL,11,T5FEx-corporal Alexander Findlay      Tj
OL,12,T5Freceived the money in an out-of-   Tj
OL,13,T5Fcourt settlement after suing the   Tj
OL,14,T5FArmy for failing to diagnose or    Tj
OL,15,T5Ftreat his condition, which he says Tj
OL,16,T5Fled to a mental breakdown.         Tj
OL,17,T5F                                   Tj
OL,18,T5FMinistry lawyers settled the case  Tj
OL,19,T5Fwithout accepting liability,       Tj
OL,20,T5Faccording to Mr Findlay's          Tj
OL,21,T5Fsolicitor, who said it was the     Tj
OL,22,T5Ffirst such settlement by the MoD.  Tj
OL,23,T-,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,.
